{"4234640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cursebreakers", "steam_appid": 4234640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/daded4a2ebb049bf607bc065f1773e15.poster.avif?t=1787823568\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/daded4a2ebb049bf607bc065f1773e15.webm?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/daded4a2ebb049bf607bc065f1773e15.mp4?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/fd6d23e1a55e56764a03559de11d618f.poster.avif?t=1787823568\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/fd6d23e1a55e56764a03559de11d618f.webm?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/fd6d23e1a55e56764a03559de11d618f.mp4?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grab a friend and dive into <strong>Cursebreakers</strong> - <strong><u>an exclusively co-op</u></strong> first-person dungeon crawler. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the risen dead, vanquish mad cultists and banish eldritch horrors on your quest to break an ancient curse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invite a friend to join for free with the Steam Friend's Pass</strong> and face the darkness <strong>together</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/b2cac4dece4a04963daca97c0c332cf4.poster.avif?t=1787823568\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/b2cac4dece4a04963daca97c0c332cf4.webm?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/b2cac4dece4a04963daca97c0c332cf4.mp4?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore together. Fight together. Die together. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend and purge the wicked in challenges <strong>crafted purely for 2 players</strong>. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine<strong> </strong>brutal<strong> </strong>melee attacks and devastating spells  in order to defeat your enemies. <strong>Fight alone and you will fail.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ your character's synergies<strong> </strong>as you traverse<strong> </strong>a hand crafted world with puzzles and platforming elements, while trying to survive from checkpoint to checkpoint. <strong>Isolate yourself and you will falter.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for artifacts and treasures that enhance or change your playstyle entirely. <strong>Will you share their power or claim it for yourself?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/259abb6d2eaa5fbe9f584b55b908e905.poster.avif?t=1787823568\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/259abb6d2eaa5fbe9f584b55b908e905.webm?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/259abb6d2eaa5fbe9f584b55b908e905.mp4?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >... and the queen awaits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of the Cursebreakers, a guild created with the sole purpose of combating ancient and new evil alike. By order of the Grand Inquisitor you're sent on a mission to free the castle of Dawnlight from the machinations of a conspiracy dating back aeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the <strong>mysteries of a haunted castle</strong>, descend into the <strong>ancient dungeons</strong> underneath and cleanse the lands of the festering corruption. <strong>Uncover the truth</strong> behind the fallen queen and her ancient burden. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Inspired by games like It Takes Two and the dungeon crawling experience of The Elder Scrolls games, this game is being created by two passionate developers with a cursed love for detail.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/daded4a2ebb049bf607bc065f1773e15.poster.avif?t=1787823568\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/daded4a2ebb049bf607bc065f1773e15.webm?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/daded4a2ebb049bf607bc065f1773e15.mp4?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/fd6d23e1a55e56764a03559de11d618f.poster.avif?t=1787823568\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/fd6d23e1a55e56764a03559de11d618f.webm?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/fd6d23e1a55e56764a03559de11d618f.mp4?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grab a friend and dive into <strong>Cursebreakers</strong> - <strong><u>an exclusively co-op</u></strong> first-person dungeon crawler. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the risen dead, vanquish mad cultists and banish eldritch horrors on your quest to break an ancient curse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invite a friend to join for free with the Steam Friend's Pass</strong> and face the darkness <strong>together</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/b2cac4dece4a04963daca97c0c332cf4.poster.avif?t=1787823568\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/b2cac4dece4a04963daca97c0c332cf4.webm?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/b2cac4dece4a04963daca97c0c332cf4.mp4?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore together. Fight together. Die together. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend and purge the wicked in challenges <strong>crafted purely for 2 players</strong>. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine<strong> </strong>brutal<strong> </strong>melee attacks and devastating spells  in order to defeat your enemies. <strong>Fight alone and you will fail.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ your character's synergies<strong> </strong>as you traverse<strong> </strong>a hand crafted world with puzzles and platforming elements, while trying to survive from checkpoint to checkpoint. <strong>Isolate yourself and you will falter.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for artifacts and treasures that enhance or change your playstyle entirely. <strong>Will you share their power or claim it for yourself?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/259abb6d2eaa5fbe9f584b55b908e905.poster.avif?t=1787823568\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/259abb6d2eaa5fbe9f584b55b908e905.webm?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/extras/259abb6d2eaa5fbe9f584b55b908e905.mp4?t=1787823568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >... and the queen awaits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of the Cursebreakers, a guild created with the sole purpose of combating ancient and new evil alike. By order of the Grand Inquisitor you're sent on a mission to free the castle of Dawnlight from the machinations of a conspiracy dating back aeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the <strong>mysteries of a haunted castle</strong>, descend into the <strong>ancient dungeons</strong> underneath and cleanse the lands of the festering corruption. <strong>Uncover the truth</strong> behind the fallen queen and her ancient burden. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Inspired by games like It Takes Two and the dungeon crawling experience of The Elder Scrolls games, this game is being created by two passionate developers with a cursed love for detail.</i></p>", "short_description": "Cursebreakers is an exclusively co-op first-person dungeon crawler. Invite a friend to join for free with Friend's Pass and master sword &amp; sorcery together. Explore a lost castle and delve into a rich dark fantasy world full of monsters, traps and magic. Defeat the fallen queen and BREAK THE CURSE!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/81ecc7f7d0ff8111d0ba0bfa947360d539ecf721/header.jpg?t=1787823568", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/4a477c5d5ed956f36b9a09cab4538398c160e643/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787823568", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234640/4a477c5d5ed956f36b9a09cab4538398c160e643/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787823568", "website": "https://falsewall.at/cursebreakers", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD RX 460<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available s